WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Omar: Can I go in here?

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Faisal: No! Go back!

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.400
Narrator: And the third: saying no.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Faisal: I'm sorry, this gate is exit only. The entrance is Gate 5, just there - two minutes. Enjoy the match!

5
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.100
Narrator: Same rule, different experience.
